  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS and Health (MAP program)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The revised project development objective is to contribute to the recipient&apos;s efforts (i) to limit the spread of HIV/AIDS and STIs; (ii) to mitigate the health and socioeconomic impact of HIV/AIDS and STIs on persons infected with or affected by HIV/AIDS and STIs; and (iii) to build strong and sustainable national capacity to respond to the HIV/AIDS epidemic.</narrative>
  </description>
