       <narrative xml:lang="EN">All 12 UDLS are functional and reporting annually and therefore the target of this indicator was achieved. In addition, theprojectsignificantly contributed to building the capacity of the coordinating national authority (SEP/CNLS) both at the managerialand technical levels.</narrative>
