      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="64%">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Source: SEP/CNLS report. Contrary to what was reported last time, this indicator increased to satisfactorily compared to baselinevalue. The difference between this value (64%) and the last one is that for the latter the percentage was calculated using thenumberof pregnant women tested instead of using the total number of positive pregnant women expected in a given year as thedenominator.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
